.Dd $Mdocdate: September 20 2026 $
.Dt FUGUORACLE-KEYGEN 8
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm fuguoracle-keygen
.Nd make the static key of the blind PIN oracle
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
makes the static key of
.Xr fuguoracle 8 .
The operator runs it one time, as root, and outside the
.Pa /var/www
chroot.
It takes no argument and no option.
.Pp
The program draws 32 random bytes, and it repeats the draw while the
value sits outside the range of the curve.
It writes the key to
.Pa /var/www/fuguoracle/private.key ,
with the owner and the group _fuguoracle, and the mode 0400.
The path is a compile-time constant, and an operator cannot move it
without a new build.
.Pp
.Nm
refuses to overwrite an existing key file.
It creates the file with
.Dv O_EXCL ,
so a second run stops with an error and leaves the key of the service
as it is.
.Pp
The program prints the compressed public key on one line of standard
output, as 66 hex digits.
The operator provisions that value into each client, and a client
needs it before it sends the first request.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/var/www/fuguoracle/private.key"
.It Pa /var/www/fuguoracle/private.key
The static key of the service, 32 raw bytes.
.Xr fuguoracle 8
reads the same file as
.Pa /fuguoracle/private.key ,
inside the
.Pa /var/www
chroot.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr pledge 2 ,
.Xr unveil 2 ,
.Xr fuguoracle 8
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Dick Olsson Aq Mt hi@senzilla.io
.Sh SECURITY CONSIDERATIONS
The static key is the secret of the whole service.
.Nm
writes the file with the mode 0400 and the owner _fuguoracle, so only
that user and root can read it.
.Pp
The program sets the core limit to zero, and it applies
.Xr pledge 2
and
.Xr unveil 2 .
It unveils the target directory alone.
The key stays in one buffer, and each exit path clears that buffer.
A failure after the creation of the file removes the file.
